{
 "$comment": "Word parity contract overrides. Generator (generate-manifest.cjs) merges these over the census ledger (key = the row's wo.match binding id, lowercased \u2014 e.g. 'bold' \u2014 or its feature id \u2014 e.g. 'table.table'). Entry fields: effektClass format|structure|dialog|op|view|stub|covered-cluster; selector: WO control selector (fallback: [data-cmd=<wo>] then #btn-<wo>); pre: prerequisite action ('file-menu' opens the File menu first); assertion: {kind: computed-style|dom-mutation|dialog-visible|op-emitted|viewport-flag, ...}; subFeatures: [{name, selector}] \u2014 dialog-visible entries MUST list them, every missing one is a FAIL; xfail: true marks a known gap (reported, non-gating); note: free text.",
 "entries": {
  "bold": {
   "effektClass": "format",
   "selector": "[data-cmd=\"bold\"]",
   "assertion": {
    "kind": "computed-style",
    "prop": "font-weight",
    "equals": "700"
   }
  },
  "italic": {
   "effektClass": "format",
   "selector": "[data-cmd=\"italic\"]",
   "assertion": {
    "kind": "computed-style",
    "prop": "font-style",
    "equals": "italic"
   }
  },
  "table.table": {
   "effektClass": "structure",
   "woTab": "insert",
   "selector": "#btn-table",
   "assertion": {
    "kind": "dom-mutation",
    "selector": "#editor table"
   },
   "post": "#btn-table-ok"
  },
  "protect.encrypt": {
   "effektClass": "dialog",
   "selector": "[data-cmd=\"protectDialog\"]",
   "assertion": {
    "kind": "dialog-visible",
    "dialogSelector": "#protect-dialog"
   },
   "subFeatures": [
    {
     "name": "restrict toggle",
     "selector": "#protect-check-restrict"
    },
    {
     "name": "password input",
     "selector": "#protect-new-password"
    },
    {
     "name": "apply action",
     "selector": "#btn-protect-apply"
    }
   ],
   "woTab": "protection"
  },
  "formatting.paragraph-line-spacing": {
   "effektClass": "dialog",
   "woTab": "home",
   "selector": "#line-spacing",
   "setValue": "options",
   "assertion": {
    "kind": "dialog-visible",
    "dialogSelector": "#paragraph-settings-dialog"
   },
   "subFeatures": [
    {
     "name": "spacing before numeric",
     "selector": "[name=spacing-before]"
    },
    {
     "name": "spacing after numeric",
     "selector": "[name=spacing-after]"
    },
    {
     "name": "first-line indent",
     "selector": "[name=first-line]"
    },
    {
     "name": "widow/orphan control",
     "selector": "[name=widow]"
    }
   ],
   "note": "ledger row promoted (L2N-01): the #line-spacing select carries a trailing value=options entry ('Line spacing options\u2026', index.html) whose change handler (editor.js) opens openParagraphSettingsDialog -> #paragraph-settings-dialog, mirroring OO's line-spacing picker leading to the paragraph dialog. setValue drives it headless (a plain .click() on a <select> fires no change); the dialog now carries the OO Spacing group fields \u2014 before/after number inputs (name=spacing-before/spacing-after -> margin-top/bottom via applyParagraphSettings) and the widow/orphan checkbox (name=widow -> class widow-control) alongside the pre-existing first-line/line-spacing/keeps. Residual divergence: OO's dialog also has 'Don't add interval between paragraphs of the same style' (right-panel census); WO defers that to the right panel."
  },
